{"id":"7a24220bb8809970","bookSlug":"zhou-machine-learning","relPath":"tinyml-lab.md","title":"tiny_ml 算法实验室","sections":["正文"],"excerpt":"tinyml 用 NumPy 实现西瓜书、Stanford CS229 和部分经典算法，让读者直接看到 fit() 背后的矩阵运算与参数更新；仓库还包含按陈天奇课件思路编写的简化版 XGBRegressor。","order":3,"previousId":"64b8b4f0b203604e","nextId":"3c7c1612390932f4","html":"<div class=\"tinyml-hero\">\n<p><span class=\"tinyml-hero__eyebrow\">NUMPY · WATERMELON BOOK · CS229</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"tiny_ml\">tiny_ml 算法实验室</h1>\n<p><code>tiny_ml</code> 用 NumPy 实现西瓜书、Stanford CS229 和部分经典算法，让读者直接看到 <code>fit()</code> 背后的矩阵运算与参数更新；仓库还包含按陈天奇课件思路编写的简化版 <code>XGBRegressor</code>。</p>\n<div class=\"tinyml-stats\"><span><b>25</b> 个 README 所列实现</span><span><b>9</b> 类算法</span><span><b>2</b> 份公式推导</span></div>\n<p><a class=\"md-button md-button--primary\" href=\"#/doc/64b8b4f0b203604e\">查看课程资源矩阵</a>\n<a class=\"md-button\" href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">打开上游仓库 ↗</a></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"admonition warning\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">学习用途与代码边界</p>\n<p>该仓库没有检测到许可证文件，因此本站不重新发布其完整源码，只做教学导览并链接到上游文件。阅读实现时请重点理解算法，不要直接把早期教学代码用于生产项目。</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"_1\">建议阅读节奏</h2>\n<div class=\"tinyml-flow\">\n  <span><b>1</b>读教材定义</span><i>→</i><span><b>2</b>看公式推导</span><i>→</i><span><b>3</b>逐行读 NumPy</span><i>→</i><span><b>4</b>与 sklearn 对照</span>\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"_2\">算法目录</h2>\n<div class=\"algorithm-grid\">\n\n<section id=\"linear-models\" class=\"algorithm-card\">\n  <header><span>01</span><div><h2>线性模型</h2><p>从闭式解到梯度更新</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/linear_model/LinearRegression.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LinearRegression</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/linear_model/LogisticRegression.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LogisticRegression</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/linear_model/SGDRegressor.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SGDRegressor</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/linear_model/LocallyWeightedLinearRegression.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LocallyWeightedLinearRegression</a>\n  </div>\n  <footer><a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/notes/linear_model/linear_reg_closed_form.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">线性回归闭式解推导 ↗</a><a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/notes/linear_model/logistic_regression.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">逻辑回归推导 ↗</a></footer>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"discriminant\" class=\"algorithm-card\">\n  <header><span>02</span><div><h2>判别分析</h2><p>从类内散度到生成式假设</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/discriminant_analysis/LDA.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LDA</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/discriminant_analysis/GDA.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GDA</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"trees\" class=\"algorithm-card\">\n  <header><span>03</span><div><h2>决策树</h2><p>分类与回归的递归划分</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/tree/DecisionTreeClassifier.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DecisionTreeClassifier</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/tree/DecisionTreeRegressor.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DecisionTreeRegressor</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"svm\" class=\"algorithm-card\">\n  <header><span>04</span><div><h2>支持向量机</h2><p>最大间隔与核函数</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/svm/SVC.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">SVC</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"bayes\" class=\"algorithm-card\">\n  <header><span>05</span><div><h2>贝叶斯</h2><p>条件独立假设下的分类</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/bayes/NaiveBayesClassifier.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NaiveBayesClassifier</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"clustering\" class=\"algorithm-card algorithm-card--wide\">\n  <header><span>06</span><div><h2>聚类算法</h2><p>原型、密度、混合分布与层次结构</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/cluster/KMeans.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KMeans</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/cluster/LVQ.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LVQ</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/cluster/GaussianMixture.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GaussianMixture</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/cluster/DBSCAN.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">DBSCAN</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/cluster/AGNES.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AGNES</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"dimensionality\" class=\"algorithm-card algorithm-card--wide\">\n  <header><span>07</span><div><h2>降维算法</h2><p>线性投影、核映射与流形学习</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/dimension_reduction/MDS.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MDS</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/dimension_reduction/PCA.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">PCA</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/dimension_reduction/KernelPCA.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KernelPCA</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/dimension_reduction/LLE.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LLE</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/dimension_reduction/Isomap.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Isomap</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"ensemble\" class=\"algorithm-card algorithm-card--wide\">\n  <header><span>08</span><div><h2>集成学习</h2><p>Bagging、Boosting 与简化 XGBoost</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/ensemble/AdaBoostClassifier.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AdaBoostClassifier</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/ensemble/GradientBoostingRegressor.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">GradientBoostingRegressor</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/ensemble/RandomForestRegressor.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">RandomForestRegressor</a>\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/ensemble/XGBRegressor.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">XGBRegressor</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"feature-selection\" class=\"algorithm-card\">\n  <header><span>09</span><div><h2>特征选择</h2><p>用近邻样本评估特征相关性</p></div></header>\n  <div class=\"algorithm-links\">\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/feature_selection/ReliefFeatureSelection.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ReliefFeatureSelection</a>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"comparison\">与 sklearn 对照</h2>\n<p>上游仓库不仅列出算法，还提供同一数据集上的实现对照。建议先阅读比较脚本，确认数据划分和指标，再解释数值差异。</p>\n<div class=\"comparison-links\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/compare/compare_regresssor.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>回归</strong><span>RMSE 对照</span></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/compare/compare_classification.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>分类</strong><span>准确率对照</span></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/compare/compare_clustering.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>聚类</strong><span>K-Means / DBSCAN / GMM / AGNES</span></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/fengyang95/tiny_ml/blob/master/tinyml/compare/compare_dimension_reduction.py\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>降维</strong><span>PCA / KernelPCA / LLE / MDS</span></a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"admonition tip\">\n<p class=\"admonition-title\">不要只看最终分数</p>\n<p>对照实验最值得检查的是：两边是否使用同一数据划分、是否发生预处理泄漏、随机种子是否一致，以及算法定义是否完全相同。上游代码使用较早期的 scikit-learn 接口，运行前应先完成兼容性检查。</p>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"_3\">和本教材如何配合</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>读第 3 章后，先看 <code>LinearRegression</code> 的闭式解，再把显式求逆改成 <code>numpy.linalg.lstsq</code>。</li>\n<li>读第 4、8 章后，对照单棵树与集成模型的误差来源。</li>\n<li>读第 9、10 章后，重点画出每次迭代或投影后的中间结果。</li>\n<li>每次阅读都记录输入形状、参数状态、目标函数、停止条件和异常输入处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a class=\"md-button md-button--primary\" href=\"#/doc/64b8b4f0b203604e\">进入课程安排</a>\n<a class=\"md-button\" href=\"/programming/ml-from-scratch/\">打开本站 NumPy 教学实验</a></p>","headings":[{"level":2,"id":"_1","text":"建议阅读节奏"},{"level":2,"id":"_2","text":"算法目录"},{"level":2,"id":"comparison","text":"与 sklearn 对照"},{"level":2,"id":"_3","text":"和本教材如何配合"}]}